masters_width_chart.py, masters_glyph_weight_chart.py and
masters_compatibility_check.py from retained fontlab-samples sources.
App masters.py shares actual reads, twelve-step transformed contour areas,
counter nesting and own-contour structural signatures; _masters_views.py
